cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its trained models in your work, please cite it as follows."
title: "External generalization and domain shift in thyroid ultrasound AI: quantifying cross-dataset performance, multi-dataset training, and the incremental value of structured features"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Open-source reproduction code for a thyroid nodule malignancy classifier
  (EfficientNetV2-S) with multi-dataset external validation. Quantifies
  cross-dataset domain shift on TN5000 / TN3K / Thy-Wise / ThyroidXL, tests
  joint multi-dataset training and equal-sample-size controls, and ablates the
  incremental value of structured clinical features (ACR TI-RADS). Includes
  patient-level splitting, bootstrap confidence intervals, calibration (ECE /
  Brier), decision curves, and full reproducibility artifacts.
